## Solution design

The system architecture combines an Arduino MKR Wi-Fi 1010 sensor device with an internet-connected web server to monitor indoor environmental parameters: temperature, humidity, air quality, and wind speed. Development followed Rapid Application Development (RAD) with iterative prototyping and user feedback.

TODO(content): architecture diagram (IN-05).

## Build

A full-stack information system (HTML/CSS/JavaScript, PHP, MySQL) presenting sensor readings through a web-based dashboard with historical data storage, time-trend graphs, and user personalization for notification thresholds and synchronization frequency.

