## Outcome

The system monitored and analyzed indoor environmental parameters (temperature, humidity, air quality, and wind speed) through a web dashboard. The undergraduate thesis defense was passed without revision, and the computer program (*Monitoring Kenyamanan Termal*) was registered under Indonesian copyright law (`EC002025076498`, Record No. `000916759`, 26 June 2025; copyright holder: Universitas Diponegoro; Desi Armanda Sari listed as creator #6 among contributors).

